<Slide style={{ background: '#F5F1E6', padding: '40px 64px', fontFamily: '宋体' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', height: 72, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.15 }}>判据：找例</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>读法四</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34' }}>找例的判据</Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 26, borderLeft: '4px solid #B4552D', paddingLeft: 24 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0 }}>例子能指回书里一句定义，</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0 }}>说得出“第几篇说的”。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 26, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.1 }}>六尺巷印证了：无讼不是没有纠纷，是有纠纷不找官。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, color: '#B4552D', lineHeight: 2.1, marginTop: 8 }}>它哪里不典型：两家的“让”是家教与声望在起作用——说说清这一层。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, marginTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.2)', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 8, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>《乡土中国》· 第 4 课时</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D' }}>15/19</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>